    "title": "No clinician assessment or plan documented",
    "message": "No assessment or plan was written for this visit despite significant renal function decline (eGFR 52, creatinine 1.4) and proteinuria on urinalysis. Guidelines require serum creatinine and eGFR monitoring for TDF-based regimens, and TDF toxicity management includes doing LFTs and RFTs when signs of renal toxicity are present. The absence of a documented plan means no action has been taken to address the progressive renal impairment or evaluate for TDF-related nephrotoxicity. The patient's fatigue, while attributed to work schedule, could also relate to declining renal function.",
